# Raft in one page

The random timeout breaks the tie. A `|` in code, and <b>raw HTML</b>.

| Name | What |
|---|---|
| `election_timeout` | the wait of a follower |

> **🧠 Hook.**
> The first follower to wake up wins.

>**⚠️ Pitfall.** A `base` of 0 divides by zero.
>
> Check it.

`src/raft.c:2-4` at `<top>`, lines 2-3 marked

```c
int election_timeout(int base)
{
▒▒▒ hidden line ▒▒▒
```

